{
  "_about": "g26b3 with even chunks (2026-10-27): chunking by sentence left 10% of the friend's ticks one word long (4% before), and in a 7-minute call g26b3 took a lone word for a sentence end and stalled after it (a lone I, then 10 s of silence; 14% of its replay utterances unfinished, g26 7%). Here a sentence's chunks are as even as they can be (7 words: 3/2/2). The tokens change, so the cache is new. Otherwise g26b3 (balanced sentence-end choices).",
  "name": "g26b4",
  "base": "gemma4a4b",
  "writer": "original",
  "prompt": "partner",
  "export_as": "talkme-partner-v1-gemma4a4b.gguf",
  "label": "Partner v1",
  "dialogues": [],
  "dialogue_files": [
    {
      "file": "out/dial_run10.jsonl",
      "per": 2,
      "filter": "no_unknown"
    },
    {
      "file": "out/dial_run10.jsonl",
      "per": 2,
      "filter": "only_unknown",
      "limit": 40
    },
    {
      "file": "out/dial_partner2.jsonl",
      "per": 2
    },
